      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Mograph basic\n\nText + 2 images -> analysis -> rule plan -> CPU soundtrack -> render 9:16 and 16:9.\n\n- Copy `tests/fixtures/*.png` from the ComfyUI-Mograph folder into `ComfyUI/input/` (or load your own images).\n- Optional: plug an AUDIO into **Mograph Analyze** to cut on its beats; the soundtrack then passes it through.\n- `duration` 0 = auto (audio length or 10 s, clamped to 5-15 s).\n- Switch Render `quality` to `full` for 1080x1920 / 1920x1080 (slower).\n- `plan_json` can be edited and fed to **Mograph Plan From JSON**."
      ],
      "title": "Note"
    }
